  "description": "<section id=\"shopify-section-template--17841483383050__image_banner\">\r\n<div id=\"Banner-template--17841483383050__image_banner\">\r\n<h2 class=\"banner__heading inline-richtext h0\">Fight ageing with Vivetus&reg;</h2>\r\n<div>\r\n<p><span>Science shows that the ageing process can be slowed down and even reversed!</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<h2 class=\"rich-text__heading rte inline-richtext h2 scroll-trigger animate--slide-in\" data-cascade=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>We believe that a balanced diet, combined with a healthy lifestyle and supported by selected supplements leads to a vital, longer life by counteracting ageing issues.</strong></span></h2>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n<section id=\"shopify-section-template--17841483383050__rich_text\">\r\n<h2 class=\"rich-text__heading rte inline-richtext h0 scroll-trigger animate--slide-in\" data-cascade=\"\">The future of healthy living</h2>\r\n<div>\r\n<p>In recent years, several<span>&nbsp;</span><strong>scientific</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>studies have shown that it is possible to slow down and even reverse the ageing process. This is<span>&nbsp;</span><strong>revolutionary<span>&nbsp;</span></strong>because ageing is often the basis for the development of diseases. Studies show that these can now very likely be prevented.</p>\r\n<p>Vivetus&reg; offers innovative nutritional supplements of the highest<span>&nbsp;</span><strong>quality and safety</strong>. Products in our range are extensively tested and comply with GMP and ISO standards. Moreover, we are committed to sustainability, because longer life is the future only in a healthy world.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>",
